<title>SPAIN: SEK issues six billion peseta 5-yr matador bond</title>
<headline>SEK issues six billion peseta 5-yr matador bond</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish Export Credit Corporation (SEK) will issue a six billion peseta matador bond, lead manager Citibank Espana said on Friday.</p>
<p>The five-year issue will pay a coupon in the first year of 7.5 percent and thereafter a coupon of 10.90 percent minus one year DEM Libor in pesetas.</p>
<p>The issue price is 101 and total fees are 1.10 percent.</p>
<p>The payment date is April 3 1997, while maturity is April 3, 2002. The redemption price will be at par. The denomination is one million pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
